{"seq":3,"slug":"conflict-resolution","title":"冲突解决策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/conflict-resolution","wordCount":864,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"冲突解决策略\">冲突解决策略</h1><h2 id=\"三路合并原理\">三路合并原理</h2><p>Git 的合并冲突解决基于<strong>三路合并（Three-Way Merge）</strong> 算法。它比较三个版本：<strong>Base（共同祖先）</strong>、<strong>Ours（当前分支）</strong> 和 <strong>Theirs（目标分支）</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    B[Base: 共同祖先] --&gt; O[Ours: 当前分支]&#10;    B --&gt; T[Theirs: 目标分支]&#10;    O --&gt; M{三路合并}&#10;    T --&gt; M&#10;    M --&gt; R[合并结果]\">graph TD\n    B[Base: 共同祖先] --&gt; O[Ours: 当前分支]\n    B --&gt; T[Theirs: 目标分支]\n    O --&gt; M{三路合并}\n    T --&gt; M\n    M --&gt; R[合并结果]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情况</th>\n<th>Base</th>\n<th>Ours</th>\n<th>Theirs</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只有 Ours 修改</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B（取 Ours）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只有 Theirs 修改</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>C（取 Theirs）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双方相同修改</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>B（自动合并）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双方不同修改</td>\n<td>A</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td><strong>冲突</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git merge feature&#10;# 查看冲突文件&#10;git diff --name-only --diff-filter=U\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看冲突文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name-only</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --diff-filter=U</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>冲突解决的本质，是让 Git 在无法自动合并时，把决策交回给人并降低重复决策的成本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>三路合并</td>\n<td>以 base、ours、theirs 三个版本比对合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冲突标记</td>\n<td>文件中标注各方版本的特殊分隔符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>diff3</td>\n<td>在冲突标记中额外显示 base 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>策略性解决</td>\n<td>用 -X ours/theirs 让冲突自动取某方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rerere</td>\n<td>记录并自动复用相同冲突的解决方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并工具</td>\n<td>可视化三方差异的外部工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"冲突标记解读\">冲突标记解读</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; HEAD&#10;echo &quot;ours: current branch version&quot;&#10;||||||| merged common ancestors&#10;echo &quot;base: original version&quot;&#10;=======&#10;echo &quot;theirs: incoming branch version&quot;&#10;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; feature\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;&#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HEAD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ours: current branch version\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|||||||</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merged</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> common</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ancestors</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"base: original version\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=======</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"theirs: incoming branch version\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>>>>>>> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">feature</span></span></code></pre></div><p>开启 <code>diff3</code> 风格查看 base 版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global merge.conflictstyle diff3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge.conflictstyle</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>| 标记区域               | 含义                   |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ------------ | -------------------- |\n| <code>&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt;&lt; HEAD</code> 到 <code>   |                        |     |     |     |     |     |</code>            | Ours（当前分支版本） |\n| <code>                     |                        |     |     |     |     |     |</code>到<code>=======</code> | Base（共同祖先版本） |\n| <code>=======</code> 到 <code>&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;</code> | Theirs（传入分支版本） |</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 强烈推荐启用 <code>diff3</code> 冲突风格，有了 Base 版本的参照，冲突解决会直观很多。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ours-与-theirs-策略\">Ours 与 Theirs 策略</h2><p>当确定某一方的版本完全正确时，可以使用策略性解决：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git merge -X ours feature&#10;git merge -X theirs feature&#10;&#10;git checkout --ours -- src/config.sh&#10;git checkout --theirs -- src/config.sh&#10;git add src/config.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ours</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -X</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> theirs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ours</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --theirs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>冲突解决方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>-X ours</code></td>\n<td>冲突时自动采用当前分支版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-X theirs</code></td>\n<td>冲突时自动采用传入分支版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>-s ours</code></td>\n<td>完全忽略对方的所有更改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--ours</code> (文件级)</td>\n<td>单个文件采用当前分支版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--theirs</code> (文件级)</td>\n<td>单个文件采用传入分支版本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>-X ours</code> 和 <code>-s ours</code> 完全不同。<code>-X ours</code> 仅在冲突时选择 ours，非冲突部分正常合并；<code>-s ours</code> 完全丢弃对方的所有更改。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"rerere-自动记忆\">Rerere 自动记忆</h2><p><strong>Rerere（Reuse Recorded Resolution）</strong> 让 Git 记住你对冲突的解决方案，当相同冲突再次出现时自动应用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global rerere.enabled true&#10;&#10;ls .git/rr-cache/&#10;&#10;git rerere status&#10;git rerere diff&#10;&#10;git rerere forget -- src/config.sh\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rerere.enabled</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/rr-cache/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rerere</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rerere</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rerere</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> forget</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/config.sh</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[首次冲突] --&gt; B[手动解决]&#10;    B --&gt; C[rerere 记录方案]&#10;    C --&gt; D[相同冲突再次出现]&#10;    D --&gt; E[rerere 自动应用]\">graph LR\n    A[首次冲突] --&gt; B[手动解决]\n    B --&gt; C[rerere 记录方案]\n    C --&gt; D[相同冲突再次出现]\n    D --&gt; E[rerere 自动应用]</pre><p>Rerere 特别有用的场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>频繁 rebase 的长期分支</td>\n<td>每次 rebase 可能遇到相同冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反复测试合并</td>\n<td>先试合并查看效果，撤销后正式合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多分支维护</td>\n<td>相同修复需要合并到多个版本分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"合并工具\">合并工具</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git mergetool&#10;&#10;git config --global merge.tool vimdiff&#10;git config --global mergetool.keepBackup false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mergetool</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge.tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vimdiff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mergetool.keepBackup</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vimdiff</td>\n<td>终端</td>\n<td>轻量，vim 用户首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VS Code</td>\n<td>GUI</td>\n<td>直观的三面板对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IntelliJ</td>\n<td>GUI</td>\n<td>智能合并建议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kdiff3</td>\n<td>GUI</td>\n<td>三路合并可视化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>meld</td>\n<td>GUI</td>\n<td>跨平台，简洁直观</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>配置 VS Code 作为合并工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git config --global merge.tool vscode&#10;git config --global mergetool.vscode.cmd &#39;code --wait --merge $REMOTE $LOCAL $BASE $MERGED&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge.tool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vscode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mergetool.vscode.cmd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'code --wait --merge $REMOTE $LOCAL $BASE $MERGED'</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"预防冲突的策略\">预防冲突的策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>频繁同步主分支</td>\n<td>定期 rebase 或 merge 主分支到功能分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小步提交</td>\n<td>减少单次提交的变更范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模块化代码</td>\n<td>减少多人修改同一文件的概率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CODEOWNERS</td>\n<td>明确文件归属，减少意外修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沟通协调</td>\n<td>修改公共文件前通知相关人员</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .github/CODEOWNERS&#10;/src/auth/    @alice&#10;/src/payment/ @bob&#10;/src/shared/  @alice @bob\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/CODEOWNERS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/src/auth/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    @alice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/src/payment/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @bob</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">/src/shared/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  @alice</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @bob</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((冲突解决))&#10;    三路合并&#10;      Base / Ours / Theirs&#10;      diff3 风格&#10;    策略选择&#10;      -X ours / theirs&#10;      -s ours&#10;      文件级选择&#10;    Rerere&#10;      自动记忆&#10;      rebase 场景&#10;    合并工具&#10;      vimdiff&#10;      VS Code&#10;      kdiff3&#10;    预防&#10;      频繁同步&#10;      CODEOWNERS&#10;      模块化\">mindmap\n  root((冲突解决))\n    三路合并\n      Base / Ours / Theirs\n      diff3 风格\n    策略选择\n      -X ours / theirs\n      -s ours\n      文件级选择\n    Rerere\n      自动记忆\n      rebase 场景\n    合并工具\n      vimdiff\n      VS Code\n      kdiff3\n    预防\n      频繁同步\n      CODEOWNERS\n      模块化</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>三路合并</strong>比较 Base、Ours、Theirs 三个版本，启用 <code>diff3</code> 风格能显著提升冲突解决效率</li>\n<li><code>-X ours/theirs</code> 在冲突时自动选择一方，但非冲突部分仍正常合并</li>\n<li><strong>Rerere</strong> 记住冲突解决方案并自动复用，对频繁 rebase 的场景价值巨大</li>\n<li>配置趁手的 <strong>merge tool</strong>（如 VS Code 三面板）可以大幅提升解决复杂冲突的效率</li>\n<li><strong>预防胜于解决</strong>：频繁同步主分支、模块化代码和 CODEOWNERS 是减少冲突的最佳实践</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"冲突解决策略","id":"冲突解决策略"},{"level":2,"text":"三路合并原理","id":"三路合并原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"冲突标记解读","id":"冲突标记解读"},{"level":2,"text":"Ours 与 Theirs 策略","id":"ours-与-theirs-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"Rerere 自动记忆","id":"rerere-自动记忆"},{"level":2,"text":"合并工具","id":"合并工具"},{"level":2,"text":"预防冲突的策略","id":"预防冲突的策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Pull Request 工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/pull-request-workflow"},"next":{"title":"Code Review 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/code-review-practices"}}